member.remarks:
The SignedAgreementPath field should be populated separately via the MVC file-upload flow; it is optional here and can be left null or supplied as a previously stored path string.
Sample request body:
POST /api/contracts { "clientId": 3, "startDate": "2026-01-01", "endDate": "2026-12-31", "status": "Draft", "serviceLevel": "Gold" }
